---
Upstream projects whose assets and semantics this work builds on (both MIT):
  * dsh-whale-musume  (https://github.com/Sutera-Diffusus/dsh-whale-musume)
      - all 92 pose illustrations, the state machine (whale-moe-core.js),
        the in-app presenter, keyword/dialogue/festival tables
  * dsh-desktop-notify (https://github.com/VoodooB0Ys/dsh-desktop-notify)
      - the notification engine, COM activator / foreground probe binaries,
        toast.ps1 & alert.ps1, click-to-focus handoff file protocol
